  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xF6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The two year project consists of establishing localized methods of drug prevention to reduce the demand for delicit drugs and increase HIV/AIDS awareness in Armenia. This will be achieved at several levels by using a pilot program to rasie the awareness level of decisionmakers, as well as policemen and techers.The partner is UNDP, which coordinates two other partners, an Armenian NGO and RNS.</narrative>
